          "label": "步骤 3",
          "text": "TLS 建立后，检查 HTTP 响应。",
          "words": 8
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:outcome",
          "kind": "outcome",
          "label": "结论",
          "text": "可以将其定位为 TLS 阶段的问题，而不是 HTTP 应用程序错误。",
          "words": 15
        }
      ],
