    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:diagnosis:paragraph:0",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "排查：从外到内逐层定位",
          "text": "如果把所有通信问题都统称为“网络故障”，就无法缩小排查范围。请按顺序逐层检查：用户使用的名称、DNS 解析结果、IP 路由、security group 等设置的端口权限、TCP/UDP、TLS 和 HTTP 响应。",
          "words": 42
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:diagnosis:paragraph:1",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "排查：从外到内逐层定位",
          "text": "明确每一层观测到的事实。如果 DNS 无法将名称解析为 IP 地址，就还没到检查端口或 HTTP 的阶段。如果 TCP 连接被拒绝，请求就尚未到达 HTTP 应用程序处理阶段。",
          "words": 47
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:diagnosis:paragraph:2",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "排查：从外到内逐层定位",
          "text": "每项更改都应对应一个关于原因的假设。扩大端口放行范围之前，先确认目标地址和端口是否确有需要，以及服务是否正在监听。修正后，重新执行同一层的观测。",
          "words": 42
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 48,
      "id": "fundamentals.networking-basics:section:diagnosis:concept:1",
      "kind": "reading",
      "label": "排查：从外到内逐层定位",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "diagnosis"
      ],
      "sectionId": "diagnosis",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.networking-basics",
      "position": 22,
      "remainingSteps": 17,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:diagnosis:scenario",
          "kind": "scenario",
          "label": "场景",
          "text": "用户无法连接到 https://app.example。",
          "words": 9
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:diagnosis:step:0",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步骤 1",
          "text": "检查 DNS 是否将域名解析为预期的 IP。",
          "words": 14
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:diagnosis:step:1",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步骤 2",
          "text": "检查能否连接到该 IP 的 443 端口。",
          "words": 11
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 20,
      "id": "fundamentals.networking-basics:section:diagnosis:example:1",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "示例",
      "objectiveIds": [
